      "id": "claim_04012964b1244f4bbb9cc213c4e02a1a",
      "statement": "The router is the public origin: it routes /api and /blueprint-screenshot to the workshop backend, /gatekeeper/<name>/* to bound gatekeepers discovered by scanning its own GATEKEEPER_* service bindings (so installing a gatekeeper is purely a binding change), and everything else to the ASSETS binding when present, falling through to the backend in dev.",
